==== Bootstrap settings ====
The bootstrap options is  similar to the [[toh:arcadyan:arv752dpw|ARV752DPW]]. The PCB design underneath the SoC is almost identical. The bootstrap option described for the ARV752DPW work on the ARV7519 as well. The resistor numbers (R65 and R80) are equal as are the points of soldering.

